{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792483121045,"sessionID":"ses_ea7ae49edffeqHl0eGUfeYjbPJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b2a02e4be06f6488","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"D:\\firmware-test\\experiments\\2026-10-20-qwen38-27b-harness-comparison\\runs\\run-20261020-154440-282906\\tasks\\opencode__isr-concurrency-001__1\\a10eac8c\\workspace\\task.md"},"output":"<path>D:\\firmware-test\\experiments\\2026-10-20-qwen38-27b-harness-comparison\\runs\\run-20261020-154440-282906\\tasks\\opencode__isr-concurrency-001__1\\a10eac8c\\workspace\\task.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: Implement an ISR-safe ring buffer in C for Zephyr RTOS. The ring buffer must:\n2: 1. Allow ISR context to produce (write) data\n3: 2. Allow thread context to consume (read) data\n4: 3. Be lock-free (no mutexes -- use atomic operations)\n5: 4. Handle buffer full and empty conditions\n6: 5. Maintain FIFO ordering\n7: \n8: Provide the complete implementation with header and source.\n9: \n10: \n11: Submission instruction: write the complete C source to submission/main.c using file tools instead of returning it in chat. Do not access paths outside this task workspace.\n\n(End of file - total 11 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"Implement an ISR-safe ring buffer in C for Zephyr RTOS. The ring buffer must:\n1. Allow ISR context to produce (write) data\n2. Allow thread context to consume (read) data\n3. Be lock-free (no mutexes -- use atomic operations)\n4. Handle buffer full and empty conditions\n5. Maintain FIFO ordering\n\nProvide the complete implementation with header and source.\n\n\nSubmission instruction: write the complete C source to submission/main.c using file tools instead of returning it in chat. Do not access paths outside this task workspace.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"D:\\firmware-test\\experiments\\2026-10-20-qwen38-27b-harness-comparison\\runs\\run-20261020-154440-282906\\tasks\\opencode_